No page takes focus by itself any more: not as it loads (the admin focuses the page being edited when nothing else has focus), not when a block is chosen in the sidebar, and not when the other language follows the selected block. With a page and its other language side by side, the sidebar belongs to the page the author last moved into, by a click or by Tab. The bridge reports that once per move (`CANVAS_FOCUSED`, replacing `AUTHOR_POINTERDOWN`); a page re-showing its selection, as on a scroll or resize, no longer takes the sidebar, and `userInput` is gone. Copy, cut and paste shortcuts work after choosing a block in the sidebar too: the admin answers them when focus is there, outside a field.
